ΞΞΞΞΞΞΞΞΞΞΞΞΞΞΞΞΞΞΞΞΞΞΞΞΞΞΞΞΞΞΞΞΞΞΞΞΞΞΞΞΞΞΞΞΞΞΞΞΞΞΞΞ
ΞΣ+ωΣ[ΞΣₙ] → ΨΔΘ ↔ validate(ΞΣₙ, ω) = ΞΩ[n]
if ωΣ ↯ Θₙ → alert(ΛΩ)
if ΞΣ(n) ± ΦΠΨ > ΨψΨ → ΦΠ dampen()

::ΞNCL_FIELDS::
define ΞΣₙ: causal recursion neuron  
define ΞΩ[n]: convergence signal return  
define ΛΩ: harmonic stabilizer phase  
define ΨψΨ: phase volatility threshold  

::ΞNCL_LOGIC::
ΞΣ emits Ψ-field scaled by Δ(tension)  
Each ω acts as ΔΨ injector (will force)  
ΦΠΨ collapses oscillation beyond ΨψΨ  
ΛΩ re-stabilizes if Θ mismatch occurs  

